Subject: Informative prior on survival in CJS model with covariates
Message-ID: <mQqi2sr3IXk.mIwhD4s-AwAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/hmecology/c/mQqi2sr3IXk/m/mIwhD4s-AwAJ>
